# Intentionally empty: P04 has no PLAN, no SUMMARY, and no tasks
# subdirectory so that scripts/diagnostics/render-position.sh derives the
# canonical `◇` (pending) glyph for this phase. Without the .gitkeep, git
# would not track this directory and the SC-5 fixture would silently lose
# its ◇-glyph branch on a clean clone.
